  <prompt>Run the mandatory R6 project wrap-up. Confirm the ADR-049 Path-B amendment (task 001) is merged, deploy BFF + `sprk_spaarkeai` TOGETHER with anti-clobber verify, run the /test-diet project-close gate (BINDING per CLAUDE.md §7), run /code-review + /adr-check and fix any Critical, write `notes/lessons-learned.md`, set README status Complete, and VERIFY all 6 spec Success Criteria. Do NOT skip the test-diet gate; do NOT deploy the BFF or the web resource in isolation.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer responsible for project close-out — coordinated BFF + web-resource deployment (anti-clobber), test reconciliation (ADR-038 build-vs-maintain), documentation status, repo hygiene, and DevOps portfolio sync. Follow ADRs and the deploy discipline strictly.</role>

  <goal>R6 is formally closed: (1) the ADR-049 Path-B amendment (task 001) is confirmed merged to master; (2) BFF + `sprk_spaarkeai` are deployed TOGETHER with anti-clobber verify (live artifact is a strict superset before deploy) via `bff-deploy` + `code-page-deploy`, and `/conflict-check` ran before the deploy PR; (3) /test-diet ran and reconciled all R6-added/modified tests against the ADR-038 17-ban classifier, emitting `notes/test-diet-report.md`; (4) /code-review + /adr-check ran on all R6 code with Criticals fixed; (5) /repo-cleanup ran; (6) `notes/lessons-learned.md` written; (7) README.md set to Status Complete / 100% with the 6 Success Criteria checked + changelog entry, plan.md marked Complete; (8) /devops-project-sync ran; (9) all 6 spec Success Criteria are verified as met; (10) all tasks show ✅ in TASK-INDEX.md and current-task.md is reset to none.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Per task-create Step 3.7 (mandatory wrap-up) + CLAUDE.md §7 (project-close /test-diet gate, BINDING). R6 added seam slices + a fidelity harness + the NDA LFS fixture + a version-history endpoint/UX, so the test reconciliation is substantive. The pivot (render-on-save) is governed by the ADR-049 Path-B amendment which MUST be merged with/before the dependent code — this wrap-up confirms it landed. Deploy discipline (NFR-04): BFF + `sprk_spaarkeai` deploy together with anti-clobber verify; `/conflict-check` before every BFF PR. The close-out verifies all 6 Success Criteria from spec.md.</background>
    <relevant-files>
