  <constraints>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md §7">The /test-diet project-close gate is BINDING — run it BEFORE marking the project complete; skipping is a HARD WARNING and the wrap-up must cite the report (or document the skip rationale). It is read-only: it emits `git rm` / `git mv` commands for the reviewer; it does not auto-execute. Do NOT delete MAINTAIN-class seam slices / the fidelity harness proving R6 constructs round-trip.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">NFR-04 deploy discipline: deploy BFF + `sprk_spaarkeai` TOGETHER; anti-clobber verify (the live artifact is a strict superset before deploy) via `bff-deploy` + `code-page-deploy`; run `/conflict-check` before the deploy PR. MUST NOT deploy the BFF or the web resource in isolation ("last deploy wins" would clobber a sibling worktree).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-049">Confirm the Path-B amendment (task 001) is merged to master — the render-on-save save path is only sanctioned once the amendment landed (not a silent deviation). If it did not merge, STOP.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Verify ALL 6 spec Success Criteria are met (NDA saves no-422 + new version; PDF NDA opens/edits/saves; template chrome provenance; version-open exact bytes; CI fidelity gate red-on-regression; publish ≤60 MB + no new HIGH CVE + placement justified). Do NOT mark complete with an unmet criterion or an open Critical.</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md §7">After completion: update task status, TASK-INDEX.md 🔲→✅, reset current-task.md to none, report completion.</constraint>
  </constraints>

