      <pattern name="Coordinated deploy" location=".claude/skills/bff-deploy/SKILL.md">Deploy BFF + `sprk_spaarkeai` together with anti-clobber verify; pair with code-page-deploy; `/conflict-check` first.</pattern>
    </patterns>
