  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Load all &lt;knowledge&gt;&lt;files&gt;. Declare RIGOR LEVEL: STANDARD (with the TEST-MODIFYING gate applying to the /test-diet + code-review step). Confirm all dependency tasks (014/027/033/042/052/061) are ✅.</step>
    <step order="1">Confirm the ADR-049 Path-B amendment (task 001) is MERGED to master. If not, STOP and escalate — the render-on-save save path is not sanctioned without it.</step>
    <step order="2">Run /conflict-check, then deploy BFF + `sprk_spaarkeai` TOGETHER with anti-clobber verify (live artifact is a strict superset before deploy) via `bff-deploy` + `code-page-deploy`. Do NOT deploy either in isolation.</step>
    <step order="3">Run /test-diet (BINDING project-close gate): reconcile all R6-added/modified tests against the ADR-038 17-ban classifier. Output notes/test-diet-report.md. Keep MAINTAIN-class seam slices + the fidelity harness; delete SCAFFOLDING-class; escalate AMBIGUOUS. If a Critical surfaces, STOP and remediate.</step>
    <step order="4">Run /code-review + /adr-check on all R6 code; fix any Critical before proceeding.</step>
    <step order="5">Run /repo-cleanup projects/spaarkeai-compose-r6 to validate structure + remove ephemeral files.</step>
    <step order="6">Verify ALL 6 spec Success Criteria are met (record evidence per criterion in the wrap-up notes); do NOT mark complete if any is unmet.</step>
    <step order="7">Append notes/lessons-learned.md (what worked, what to change, coordination outcomes with the sibling Compose worktrees + ci-cd-unit-test-remediation-r1).</step>
    <step order="8">Update README.md → Status Complete / 100% with the 6 Success Criteria checked + changelog entry; update plan.md → Status Complete.</step>
    <step order="9">Run /devops-project-sync to update the portfolio Issue fields from local state (archive optional).</step>
    <step order="10">Verify all tasks show ✅ in TASK-INDEX.md; reset current-task.md to none (project complete). Run the final build + full Compose seam/unit suites + fidelity harness green after any test-diet deletions/moves.</step>
    <step order="11">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set this task's status to ✅ completed. Document any deviation in projects/spaarkeai-compose-r6/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If the ADR-049 Path-B amendment did NOT merge, STOP — the render-on-save save path is a silent ADR deviation without it (CLAUDE.md §6.5).</trigger>
    <trigger>If /test-diet or /code-review surfaces a Critical, or any of the 6 Success Criteria is unmet, STOP and remediate before marking the project complete. Do NOT skip the test-diet gate (HARD WARNING per CLAUDE.md §7) — the wrap-up PR MUST cite notes/test-diet-report.md or document the skip rationale.</trigger>
    <trigger>If anti-clobber verify shows the live artifact is NOT a strict superset (a sibling worktree deployed newer code), STOP — deploying would clobber it; coordinate before proceeding.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <tools>
    <tool name="dotnet">Run the final build + seam/unit suites + fidelity harness after test-diet reconciliation.</tool>
    <tool name="terminal">Run /conflict-check, bff-deploy, code-page-deploy, /test-diet, /code-review, /adr-check, /repo-cleanup, /devops-project-sync.</tool>
  </tools>

