  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the pivot, when close-out runs, then the ADR-049 Path-B amendment (task 001) is confirmed merged to master.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given deploy, when it runs, then BFF + `sprk_spaarkeai` deploy TOGETHER with anti-clobber verify (strict-superset check) and `/conflict-check` ran first — neither deployed in isolation.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the project is closing, when /test-diet runs, then notes/test-diet-report.md reconciles all R6 tests against the ADR-038 17-ban classifier and MAINTAIN-class seam slices + the fidelity harness are kept.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given all R6 code, when /code-review + /adr-check run, then any Critical is fixed before completion.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given close-out, when README.md + plan.md are updated, then both read Status Complete (README 100% with the 6 Success Criteria checked + changelog entry) and lessons-learned.md is appended.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the 6 spec Success Criteria, when verified, then each is met with recorded evidence; the project is NOT marked complete otherwise.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: the project is NOT marked complete if the amendment did not merge, the test-diet gate was skipped without a cited report/rationale, a Critical remains open, anti-clobber verify failed, or any Success Criterion is unmet.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the task ledger, when close-out completes, then every task in TASK-INDEX.md shows ✅ and current-task.md is reset to none.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Mandatory wrap-up per task-create Step 3.7 + CLAUDE.md §7 (test-diet project-close gate BINDING). Prescriptive ordered close-out. Deploy BFF + `sprk_spaarkeai` together (anti-clobber; NFR-04). Confirm ADR-049 amendment merged. Verify all 6 spec Success Criteria. Do not skip the test-diet gate.

COMPLETED 2026-08-13. Step outcomes: (1) ADR-049 R6 Path-B amendment VERIFIED on origin/master (line ~80, merged with 001's code). (2) Deploy step resolved per escalation trigger 3 as a DOCUMENTED NO-OP: the full R6 surface deployed atomically 2026-08-07 17:25/17:26Z (12 min after PR #747) and wrap-up anti-clobber verify confirmed today's live artifacts (r2 deploys, BFF 13:12Z + code page 18:04Z) are a STRICT SUPERSET carrying both R6 markers and r2's newer work — redeploying from this worktree would have clobbered r2's active session, the exact scenario the constraint forbids. (3) /test-diet: 37 files / 281 tests, ZERO scaffolding/ambiguous/path-violations; one MAINTAIN-conditional note (stamper tests retire WITH the transitional path); report at notes/test-diet-report.md. (4) Cross-slice close-out review agent + full-suite adr-check mechanical layer (arch guardrails + I-7 lexical audit green); per-task Step 9.5 records cited (9 reviews, all findings closed). (5) repo-cleanup clean (Corteva docx deliberately untracked pending sign-off). (6) All 6 Success Criteria verified with evidence (README). (7) lessons-learned.md written. (8) README Complete/100% + changelog; plan Complete. (9) devops-sync degraded to WARN — R6 has no portfolio Project Issue (never registered). (10) TASK-INDEX 30/30 ✅; current-task reset to none. Deviation record: deploy no-op rationale above; devops warn.</notes>

